WEBVTT

00:07.137 --> 00:08.480
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.481 --> 00:10.101
<i>kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!</i>
<i>孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！</i>

00:10.102 --> 00:11.653
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:11.654 --> 00:13.722
<i>kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!</i>
<i>孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！</i>

00:13.723 --> 00:16.722
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:16.723 --> 00:18.756
<i>♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪</i>
<i>♪谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪</i>

00:18.757 --> 00:20.825
<i>kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!</i>
<i>孩子们：
海绵宝宝！</i>

00:20.826 --> 00:22.653
<i>♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪</i>
<i>♪ 吸水性、黄色
他是多孔的 ♪</i>

00:22.654 --> 00:24.584
<i>kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!</i>
<i>孩子们：
海绵宝宝！</i>

00:24.585 --> 00:26.791
<i>♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪</i>

00:26.792 --> 00:28.860
<i>kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!</i>
<i>孩子们：
海绵宝宝！</i>

00:28.861 --> 00:30.756
<i>♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪</i>

00:30.757 --> 00:32.722
<i>kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?</i>
<i>孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好了吗？</i>

00:32.723 --> 00:34.549
<i>all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!</i>
<i>全部：
海绵宝宝！</i>

00:34.550 --> 00:38.722
<i>SpongeBob SquarePants!</i>
<i>海绵宝宝！</i>

00:38.723 --> 00:40.101
<i>SpongeBob</i>
<i>海绵宝宝</i>

00:40.102 --> 00:41.964
<i>SquarePants!</i>
<i>方裤！</i>

01:02.862 --> 01:04.756
Oh, Lady Upturn!
哦，翻转女士！

01:04.757 --> 01:07.446
Always a delight to
have you back at our gallery.
总是令人高兴
您回到我们的画廊了吗？

01:07.447 --> 01:09.929
I'm bored by the art
in my home.
我对艺术感到厌倦
在我家。

01:09.930 --> 01:13.791
What do you have that's
new and interesting?
你有什么那是
新奇有趣？

01:13.792 --> 01:15.377
Ick.
恶心。

01:15.378 --> 01:18.032
Oh, I-I've been saving
our newest and finest
哦，我-我一直在节省
我们最新最好的

01:18.033 --> 01:19.929
pieces just for you.
专为您打造的作品。

01:19.930 --> 01:23.170
This work is by one of
our emerging artists.
这项工作是由其中一位
我们的新兴艺术家。

01:23.171 --> 01:24.618
Bleh.
布莱赫。

01:24.619 --> 01:28.170
Where did they emerge
from, under a rock?
他们在哪里出现
从岩石下？

01:28.171 --> 01:30.860
Ah, how did you know?
啊，你怎么知道？

01:30.861 --> 01:34.308
Lady Upturn,
I am so, so sorry.
女士逆袭，
我实在是太、太抱歉了。

01:34.309 --> 01:37.724
I should never have
shown you that dreck.
我不应该有
给你看了那个烂摊子。

01:40.379 --> 01:42.273
Never fear.
永远不要害怕。

01:42.274 --> 01:46.171
This next work is
guaranteed to excite.
下一个作品是
保证令人兴奋。

01:48.655 --> 01:50.756
Bikini Bottom's
premier dance troupe
比基尼泳裤
首屈一指的舞蹈团

01:50.757 --> 01:53.239
has created
a performance so new,
已创建
如此新颖的表演，

01:53.240 --> 01:55.309
even they don't
know what it is yet.
即使他们不
还知道它是什么。

02:03.310 --> 02:04.722
Yawn.
打哈欠。

02:04.723 --> 02:07.480
Moving in time to
music is hardly new.
及时移动到
音乐并不新鲜。

02:07.481 --> 02:09.862
This does nothing
for me, either.
这没有任何作用
对我来说也是如此。

02:13.241 --> 02:15.549
Oh, surely, there's
something here you'll enjoy.
哦，当然有
这里有你会喜欢的东西。

02:15.550 --> 02:18.032
No, I'm afraid not.
不，恐怕不是。

02:18.033 --> 02:19.618
Regigilled!
重新调整！

02:19.619 --> 02:22.411
I need a walk to clear my mind.
我需要散散步来理清思绪。

02:22.412 --> 02:25.688
Carry me.
- Very good, ma'am.
带我吧
- 很好，女士。

02:28.000 --> 02:30.862
Alas, I have failed.
唉，我失败了。

02:32.724 --> 02:34.067
Ow.
噢。

02:37.482 --> 02:41.412
Whoo!
呼！

02:46.793 --> 02:49.757
No!
不！

02:58.241 --> 03:00.411
- Oh?
- Oh.
- 哦？
- 哦。

03:00.412 --> 03:02.170
My apologies, madam.
抱歉，女士。

03:02.171 --> 03:06.066
I shall remove your person
from this cacophony at once.
我要把你的人除掉
立即从这刺耳的声音中消失。

03:06.067 --> 03:09.032
No, no, Regigilled.
Take me closer.
不，不，雷吉利德。
带我靠近一点。

03:09.033 --> 03:11.136
As you wish.
如你所愿。

03:12.931 --> 03:14.170
You, there!
你在那里！

03:14.171 --> 03:15.584
Yes, you!
是的，就是你！

03:15.585 --> 03:18.308
I'm allowed to play
my clarinet here.
我被允许玩
我的单簧管在这里。

03:18.309 --> 03:20.273
It's a free ocean, you know.
你知道，这是一片自由的海洋。

03:20.274 --> 03:21.756
I'm not stopping!
我不会停下来！

03:21.757 --> 03:23.066
Stop?
停止？

03:23.067 --> 03:25.032
I wouldn't dream of it.
我做梦都不会想到这一点。

03:25.033 --> 03:28.963
That is the most interesting
and avant-garde music
这才是最有趣的
和前卫音乐

03:28.964 --> 03:31.066
I have heard in years.
我听了很多年了。

03:31.067 --> 03:33.549
Oh, it is sublime.
哦，真是崇高。

03:33.550 --> 03:37.135
Do you have a patron?
I simply must be yours.
你有赞助人吗？
我只是必须属于你。

03:37.136 --> 03:39.377
Yeah, yeah, very funny.
是啊是啊，非常搞笑。

03:39.378 --> 03:42.515
What is this, one of those
hidden-camera TV prank shows?
这是什么，其中之一
隐藏摄像头电视恶作剧？

03:42.516 --> 03:43.963
Heavens, no.
天啊，不。

03:43.964 --> 03:46.377
Television
is the lowest form of art.
电视
是最低级的艺术形式。

03:46.378 --> 03:48.170
Regigilled, pay the man.
重新登记，付钱给那个人。

03:48.171 --> 03:51.654
You can't just buy the soul
of a raw talent like myself.
你不能只买灵魂
像我这样的原始人才。

03:53.517 --> 03:56.516
Lady, you just bought
yourself an artist.
小姐，你刚买的
你自己是一位艺术家。

04:00.000 --> 04:02.825
Hello, losers.
你好，失败者。

04:02.826 --> 04:04.135
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

04:04.136 --> 04:06.791
What's with all the joy,
Mr. Squidward?
满心欢喜又有何妨
章鱼哥先生？

04:06.792 --> 04:10.239
I'm a paid musician now.
我现在是一名付费音乐家。

04:10.240 --> 04:13.309
You?
Musician? Paid?
你？
音乐家？有薪酬的？

04:15.103 --> 04:17.894
Laugh all you want,
but it's true.
想笑就笑吧
但这是真的。

04:17.895 --> 04:21.342
I don't need this minimum-wage
prison anymore.
我不需要这个最低工资
不再坐牢了。

04:21.343 --> 04:23.447
I quit.
我不干了。

04:31.275 --> 04:32.550
Huh?
啊？

04:38.206 --> 04:39.687
Wow!
哇！

04:39.688 --> 04:42.723
Squidward's dreams are
finally coming true.
章鱼哥的梦想是
终于实现了。

04:49.172 --> 04:53.343
Welcome to your new home,
Mr. Tentacles.
欢迎来到你的新家，
触手先生。

04:57.379 --> 04:59.860
Oh, my, it's incredible.
哦，天哪，这太不可思议了。

04:59.861 --> 05:02.308
But where are you
going to live?
但你在哪里
要去住吗？

05:02.309 --> 05:05.894
The mansion is mine.
豪宅是我的。

05:05.895 --> 05:09.273
You just get one tiny room.
你只得到一间小房间。

05:09.274 --> 05:12.135
Oh, my.
哦，我的。

05:12.136 --> 05:13.963
Wow!
哇！

05:13.964 --> 05:15.825
I cannot wait to show you off
我迫不及待地想向你炫耀

05:15.826 --> 05:18.653
to my wealthy,
taste-making friends,
致我的富人，
品味交友，

05:18.654 --> 05:20.480
so you better get writing.
所以你最好开始写作。

05:20.481 --> 05:21.929
Yes, ma'am, ma'am.
是的，女士，女士。

05:21.930 --> 05:25.136
Toodle-oo, you genius, you.
Toodle-oo，你是天才。

06:36.344 --> 06:39.411
Out of my way, peon.
别挡我的路，苦工。

06:39.412 --> 06:41.239
So sorry, my lord.
非常抱歉，陛下。

06:41.240 --> 06:42.653
Wow, Squidward.
哇，章鱼哥。

06:42.654 --> 06:45.204
That was very, uh,
confident of you.
那是非常，呃，
对你有信心。

06:45.205 --> 06:46.825
Yes.
是的。

06:46.826 --> 06:50.480
Being an artist requires
having an artist's temperament,
成为一名艺术家需要
具有艺术家气质，

06:50.481 --> 06:51.585
you boob.
你个布布。

06:52.862 --> 06:54.239
What took you so long?
是什么让你花了这么长时间？

06:54.240 --> 06:57.032
Now, then, I'm only
here to invite you
那么现在我只
在此邀请您

06:57.033 --> 07:00.067
both to my big debut concert.
都参加了我的大型首场音乐会。

07:02.724 --> 07:04.894
Huh?
啊？

07:04.895 --> 07:08.618
Witness my rebirth
on the grandest stage
见证我的重生
在最盛大的舞台上

07:08.619 --> 07:10.687
in Bikini Bottom...
在比基尼底部...

07:10.688 --> 07:14.860
if you can get the time off.
如果你能抽出时间的话。

07:14.861 --> 07:17.653
Somehow,
he's even more annoying now
不知何故，
他现在更烦人了

07:17.654 --> 07:19.204
than when he worked here.
比他在这里工作时还要多。

07:19.205 --> 07:20.756
Wait, Mr. Krabs.
等等，蟹老板。

07:20.757 --> 07:24.170
Squidward is just being
insufferable because his dreams
章鱼哥只是
因为他的梦想而难以忍受

07:24.171 --> 07:25.860
are coming true.
即将实现。

07:25.861 --> 07:28.860
We have to go and support him.
We're his friends.
我们必须去支持他。
我们是他的朋友。

07:28.861 --> 07:33.172
Well, "friends"
is a strong word, but fine.
嗯，“朋友”
这是一个很强烈的词，但是很好。

07:39.793 --> 07:41.308
Hiya, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

07:41.309 --> 07:43.687
Mr. Krabs and I just wanted
to wish you luck
蟹老板和我只是想要
祝你好运

07:43.688 --> 07:45.446
before your big show.
在你的大型演出之前。

07:45.447 --> 07:48.377
Luck?
Don't be stupid.
运气？
别傻了。

07:48.378 --> 07:51.825
I'm the greatest musician
who ever lived.
我是最伟大的音乐家
谁曾住过。

07:51.826 --> 07:53.827
Rich people say so.
有钱人都这么说。

07:56.310 --> 07:59.170
- Can't argue with money.
- Now, go find your seats.
- 不能与金钱争论。
- 现在，去找座位吧。

07:59.171 --> 08:01.239
I'm in the middle
of my pre-show ritual,
我在中间
我的演出前仪式，

08:01.240 --> 08:04.446
and I don't want
to be bothered.
我不想
被打扰。

08:04.447 --> 08:06.241
Eh.
呃。

08:13.793 --> 08:15.791
Good evening, music lovers.
晚上好，音乐爱好者们。

08:15.792 --> 08:20.687
Like me, I'm sure you are tired
of the same old notes being
和我一样，我相信你也累了
相同的旧笔记是

08:20.688 --> 08:23.480
played the same old ways.
还是用同样的老方法。

08:23.481 --> 08:24.929
Well, fear not.
好吧，不用害怕。

08:24.930 --> 08:28.756
Tonight you will finally
hear something new.
今晚你终于
听到一些新的东西。

08:28.757 --> 08:32.308
Tonight I present to you
今晚我向你呈现

08:32.309 --> 08:35.309
Mr. Squidward Tentacles.
章鱼哥触手先生。

08:40.448 --> 08:42.135
Forget your wedding.
忘记你的婚礼。

08:42.136 --> 08:44.998
Forget the birth
of your first child.
忘记出生
你的第一个孩子的。

08:44.999 --> 08:46.998
This is going to be
这将是

08:46.999 --> 08:50.171
the greatest night
of your lives.
最伟大的夜晚
你的生活。

08:51.482 --> 08:53.205
all:
Oh!
全部：
哦！

09:15.862 --> 09:19.480
Oh, isn't it
dazzling, Doctor?
哦，不是吗
眼花缭乱，博士？

09:19.481 --> 09:23.448
Oh.
哦。

09:25.413 --> 09:27.308
Hmm.
Mm-hmm.
唔。
嗯嗯。

09:27.309 --> 09:29.032
Mm-hmm.
Yes.
嗯嗯。
是的。

09:29.033 --> 09:31.411
Pardon me, Lady Upturn.
请原谅，Upturn 女士。

09:31.412 --> 09:32.584
May I...?
我可以...？

09:32.585 --> 09:35.619
Of course, Dr. Fishberg.
当然，菲什伯格博士。

09:37.206 --> 09:41.825
Lady Upturn, there's
a jellyfish blocking your ears.
翻转女士，有
水母挡住了你的耳朵。

09:41.826 --> 09:43.618
Oh, goodness!
哦，天哪！

09:43.619 --> 09:46.584
It must have gotten
stuck up there during my walk
一定已经得到了
我走路时被卡在那里

09:46.585 --> 09:49.792
through Jellyfish Fields.
穿过水母田。

09:51.793 --> 09:56.171
Oh. Is that what
he really sounds like?
哦。是这样吗
他听起来真的像吗？

09:58.034 --> 10:01.618
This music is terrible!
这音乐太可怕了！

10:01.619 --> 10:03.342
Indeed.
的确。

10:03.343 --> 10:05.860
The jellyfish's buzzing
must have altered the noise
水母在嗡嗡叫
一定改变了噪音

10:05.861 --> 10:08.273
to be more pleasurable for you.
为您带来更多乐趣。

10:08.274 --> 10:09.550
Oh!
哦！

10:15.379 --> 10:17.101
Stop that racket!
停止那个喧闹！

10:17.102 --> 10:18.653
Stop it!
停下来！

10:18.654 --> 10:20.791
How dare you interrupt m--
你怎么敢打断我——

10:20.792 --> 10:22.792
I have a confession to make.
我有件事要坦白。

10:24.206 --> 10:27.308
A jellyfish was
obstructing my ears,
一只水母是
挡住我的耳朵，

10:27.309 --> 10:31.066
so I hadn't truly heard
this fraud's music.
所以我并没有真正听到
这个骗局的音乐。

10:31.067 --> 10:33.515
And now that I have,
现在我有了，

10:33.516 --> 10:36.273
I am offended!
我很生气！

10:36.274 --> 10:37.584
Hey!
嘿！

10:37.585 --> 10:41.101
To make up for this
abysmal performance,
为了弥补这一点
糟糕的表现，

10:41.102 --> 10:43.653
I would like to invite
you all back to my home
我想邀请
你们都回我家吧

10:43.654 --> 10:45.963
to experience real music
体验真正的音乐

10:45.964 --> 10:50.549
by my newest artiste,
Maestro Patrick Star.
由我最新的艺人创作，
帕特里克·斯塔大师。

10:50.550 --> 10:51.757
What?
什么？

11:05.241 --> 11:07.274
Yay!
耶！

11:15.000 --> 11:17.688
Huh? Uh...
啊？呃...

11:23.275 --> 11:24.791
Oh.
哦。

11:24.792 --> 11:27.101
- Whoo! Go, Squidward!
- Encore! Encore!
- 呼！走吧，章鱼哥！
- 安可！安可！

11:27.102 --> 11:28.963
We want more!
我们想要更多！

11:28.964 --> 11:31.480
- We want more!
- Do you really mean it?
- 我们想要更多！
- 你真的是这个意思吗？

11:31.481 --> 11:32.894
Of course.
当然。

11:32.895 --> 11:35.204
We've got jellyfish.
我们有水母。

11:35.205 --> 11:36.618
Huh.
呵呵。

11:36.619 --> 11:38.171
I'll take what I can get.
我会拿走我能得到的。

11:39.827 --> 11:41.687
- Yeah! Whoo!
- Whoo-hoo!
- 是的！呼！
- 呼呼！

11:41.688 --> 11:43.481
Come on, Squidward!
加油，章鱼哥！

加油，章鱼哥！